{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32585","headline":"题龙门僧房 · 刘沧","name":"题龙门僧房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"静室遥临伊水东，寂寥谁与此身同。\n禹门山色度寒磬，萧寺竹声来晚风。\n僧宿石龛残雪在，鴈归沙渚夕阳空。\n偶将心地问高士，坐指浮生一梦中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32585.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32585","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}